<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Syxx Lyin' Eyes — DNS Investigation Suite</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="assets/syxx-favicon.png">

  <meta name="description" content="Every resolver tells a story. Syxx traces DNS lookups end to end — spoofed answers, poisoned caches, silent exfiltration — and shows you exactly which responses are lying.">
  <meta name="keywords" content="DNS, DNS security, resolver, spoofing, exfiltration, macOS, Windows, network toolbelt">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Syxx Lyin' Eyes — DNS Investigation Suite">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Syxx traces DNS lookups end to end and shows you exactly which responses are lying.">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@500;600;700&family=EB+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400;1,500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    :root {
      --io-bg: #0b0518;
      --io-surface: #170c2e;
      --io-surface-elevated: #1d1640;
      --io-border: #382c66;
      --io-text: #efeafe;
      --io-text-secondary: #c9c1e6;
      --io-text-body: #c9c1e6;
      --io-blue: #7c5cff;
      --io-electric: #a78bff;
      --io-accent-start: #d9a441;
      --io-accent-end: #5b3fd6;
      --io-eyebrow: #d9a441;
      --io-critical: #ff4d6d;
      --io-ok: #2dd4bf;
      --io-teal: #2dd4bf;
      --io-gold: #d9a441;
      --font-sans: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      --font-display: 'Cinzel', Georgia, serif;
      --font-mono: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: radial-gradient(130% 80% at 15% 0%, #1a0c33 0%, #0b0518 55%);
      background-attachment: fixed;
      color: var(--io-text);
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 12px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--io-surface-elevated); border-radius: 999px; border: 3px solid var(--io-bg); }

    a { color: inherit; }
    .hidden { display: none !important; }

    @keyframes syxxGlow { 0%, 100% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: .4; } }

    .wrap { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 32px; padding-right: 32px; }

    /* ---- Beta banner ---- */
    .beta-banner {
      display: block; width: 100%; text-align: left; cursor: pointer;
      margin: 12px auto 0; padding: 22px 30px; border-radius: 20px;
      border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--io-blue) 34%, transparent);
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--io-electric) 12%, transparent);
      color: #e9deff; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.4;
      transition: border-color .2s;
    }
    .beta-banner:hover { border-color: var(--io-electric); }
    .beta-banner .row { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .beta-banner b { color: #fff; }
    .beta-banner .arrow { color: var(--io-electric); font-weight: 700; font-size: 28px; flex-shrink: 0; }

    /* ---- Nav ---- */
    .nav {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 20; margin-top: 12px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      background: rgba(11,5,24,.82); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--io-border);
    }
    .nav .inner { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding-top: 14px; padding-bottom: 14px; }
    .nav-logo { display: block; border-radius: 8px; }
    .wordmark {
      font-family: 'Cinzel', Georgia, serif;
      font-weight: 700; font-size: 19px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff9a3d, #ff2d78, #9a5cff);
      -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent;
    }
    .nav .spacer { flex: 1; }
    .nav a.link { font-size: 14px; color: var(--io-text-secondary); text-decoration: none; padding: 0 6px; transition: color .2s; }
    .nav a.link:hover { color: #fff; }
    .btn-nav {
      margin-left: 8px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff;
      background: var(--io-blue); padding: 9px 18px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none;
      transition: filter .2s;
    }
    .btn-nav:hover { filter: brightness(1.1); }

    /* ---- Buttons ---- */
    .btn {
      cursor: pointer; border: none; border-radius: 10px; font-family: var(--font-sans);
      font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; color: #fff;
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, #7c5cff, #5b3fd6);
      padding: 0 22px; transition: filter .2s, transform .1s;
    }
    .btn:hover { filter: brightness(1.06); }
    .btn:active { transform: translateY(1px); }
    .btn-solid { background: var(--io-blue); }

    /* ---- Hero ---- */
    .hero { max-width: 840px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 68px 32px 40px; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 22px; }
    .hero-logo { width: 118px; height: 118px; border-radius: 27px; box-shadow: 0 0 70px rgba(140,80,240,.4), 0 14px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.55); }
    .eyebrow { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--io-eyebrow); margin-bottom: 14px; }
    h1.hero-title {
      margin: 0; font-family: 'Cinzel', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 66px; line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -.01em;
      background: linear-gradient(100deg, #f0ac38 8%, #efe0ff 50%, #a96ad6 92%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent;
    }
    .hero-desc { margin: 0; max-width: 620px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--io-text-body); }

    .investigate { display: flex; gap: 12px; width: 100%; max-width: 560px; margin-top: 6px; }
    .field {
      flex: 1; background: var(--io-bg); border: 1px solid var(--io-border); border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 14px 16px; color: #fff; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 15px; outline: none;
      transition: border-color .2s;
    }
    .field:focus { border-color: var(--io-blue); }
    .investigate .btn { min-width: 140px; height: 50px; }

    .gate-row { display: flex; gap: 12px; width: 100%; max-width: 560px; }
    .gate-msg { font-size: 13px; color: var(--io-eyebrow); min-height: 18px; text-align: center; max-width: 560px; }

    .live { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--io-text-secondary); }
    .dot-live { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--io-eyebrow); box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--io-eyebrow); animation: syxxGlow 1.6s infinite; }

    /* ---- Console ---- */
    .console-sec { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 30px 32px 56px; }
    .terminal { border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--io-border); box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.5); }
    .term-bar { height: 40px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 16px; background: rgba(20,14,32,.9); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--io-border); position: relative; }
    .term-bar .dots { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
    .term-bar .dots span { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; }
    .d-red { background: #ff5f57; } .d-yellow { background: #febc2e; } .d-green { background: #28c840; }
    .term-bar .title { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; text-align: center; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--io-text-secondary); pointer-events: none; }
    .term-body { margin: 0; padding: 22px 24px; background: #07040f; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #c9c1e6; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; height: 340px; overflow-y: auto; }
    .t-cmd { color: #e9deff; } .t-dim { color: #7d719e; } .t-ok { color: var(--io-ok); }
    .t-gold { color: var(--io-accent-start); } .t-bad { color: var(--io-critical); } .t-info { color: var(--io-electric); }

    /* ---- Section headers ---- */
    .sec { padding: 40px 32px; }
    .sec-head { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 36px; }
    .sec-eyebrow { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--io-eyebrow); }
    .sec-title { margin: 10px 0 0; font-weight: 700; font-size: 36px; }

    /* ---- Feature cards ---- */
    .grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; }
    .card { background: var(--io-surface); border: 1px solid var(--io-border); border-radius: 16px; padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; transition: transform .2s, border-color .2s; }
    .card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--io-electric) 45%, transparent); }
    .card-icon { width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--io-blue) 16%, transparent); color: var(--io-electric); }
    .card-title { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; }
    .card-desc { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--io-text-secondary); }

    .tools-label { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--io-eyebrow); text-align: center; margin: 44px 0 20px; }
    .tool { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; background: var(--io-bg); border: 1px solid var(--io-border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; }
    .tool .n { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--io-electric); padding-top: 2px; }
    .tool .name { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; }
    .tool .desc { font-size: 13px; color: var(--io-text-secondary); line-height: 1.45; margin-top: 2px; }

    /* ---- Pricing ---- */
    .pricing { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .price-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 18px; align-items: start; }
    .plan { background: var(--io-surface); border: 1px solid var(--io-border); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
    .plan-pro { background: linear-gradient(155deg, color-mix(in srgb, #d9a441 11%, var(--io-surface)), color-mix(in srgb, #5b3fd6 18%, var(--io-surface))); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, #7c5cff 46%, transparent); box-shadow: 0 0 26px rgba(124,92,255,.25); }
    .plan h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; }
    .plan .price { font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; }
    .plan .price small { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--io-text-secondary); }
    .plan .blurb { font-size: 14px; color: var(--io-text-body); line-height: 1.5; }
    .plan .blurb.dim { color: var(--io-text-secondary); }
    .pill { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #1a1030; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 6px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d9a441, #7c5cff); }
    .plan-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    .plan .btn { height: 44px; width: 100%; }

    /* ---- Download ---- */
    .download { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 32px 72px; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 20px; }
    .download h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 700; }
    .store-row { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
    .store { text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; background: #0c0820; border: 1px solid var(--io-border); padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 12px; transition: border-color .2s; }
    .store:hover { border-color: var(--io-blue); }
    .store .sub { display: block; font-size: 11px; color: var(--io-text-secondary); }
    .store .big { display: block; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff; }
    .or-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; width: 100%; max-width: 420px; margin-top: 4px; }
    .or-row span.line { flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--io-border); }
    .or-row span.lbl { font-size: 12px; color: var(--io-text-secondary); }
    .direct-row { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
    .direct { text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff; background: var(--io-surface-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--io-border); padding: 11px 20px; border-radius: 10px; }
    .direct .ext { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--io-text-secondary); }
    .platform-note { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--io-text-secondary); margin-top: 4px; }

    /* ---- Footer ---- */
    .footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--io-border); }
    .footer .inner { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 24px 32px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .footer .name { font-size: 13px; color: var(--io-text-secondary); }
    .footer .plat { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--io-text-secondary); }

    /* ---- Beta page ---- */
    .beta-page { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .beta-nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 14px 32px; max-width: 1120px; width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; }
    .link-btn { cursor: pointer; background: transparent; border: none; color: var(--io-text-secondary); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 14px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 0; }
    .link-btn:hover { color: #fff; }
    .beta-header { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 32px 20px; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }
    h1.beta-title { margin: 0; font-weight: 700; font-size: 52px; line-height: 1.04; background: linear-gradient(100deg, #f0ac38 8%, #efe0ff 50%, #a96ad6 92%); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; }
    .beta-intro { margin: 0; max-width: 640px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--io-text-body); }
    .beta-intro b { color: #efe6ff; }
    .beta-body { max-width: 1000px; width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; padding: 12px 32px 64px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
    .showcase { background: var(--io-surface); border: 1px solid var(--io-border); border-radius: 18px; padding: 28px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 26px; align-items: center; }
    .showcase .head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 13px; }
    .showcase .head img { display: block; object-fit: contain; }
    .showcase .prod { font-size: 23px; font-weight: 700; }
    .showcase .tag { font-size: 13px; color: var(--io-text-secondary); }
    .points { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px; }
    .point { display: flex; gap: 9px; align-items: flex-start; }
    .point svg { flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }
    .point span { font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--io-text-body); }
    .shots { display: flex; gap: 12px; background: var(--io-bg); border: 1px solid var(--io-border); border-radius: 14px; padding: 14px; align-items: center; }
    .shots img { min-width: 0; height: 190px; object-fit: contain; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--io-border); background: #0a1120; }

    .signup { background: linear-gradient(120deg, color-mix(in srgb, #f0ac38 8%, var(--io-surface)), color-mix(in srgb, #7c3aed 16%, var(--io-surface))); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, #a96ad6 40%, transparent); border-radius: 18px; padding: 24px 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
    .signup h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; }
    .checks { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .check { flex: 1; min-width: 220px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; background: var(--io-bg); border: 1px solid var(--io-border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; }
    .check input { width: 18px; height: 18px; accent-color: var(--io-blue); cursor: pointer; }
    .check img { display: block; object-fit: contain; }
    .check .lbl { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
    .check .lbl small { font-weight: 400; color: var(--io-text-secondary); }
    .signup-row { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .signup-row .field { min-width: 240px; }
    .signup-row .btn { min-width: 200px; height: 48px; }
    .signup-msg { font-size: 14px; color: #efe6ff; min-height: 18px; }

    /* ---- Responsive ---- */
    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      h1.hero-title { font-size: 44px; }
      h1.beta-title { font-size: 38px; }
      .grid-3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .price-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .showcase { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .showcase .shots-cell { order: 2; }
      .nav a.link { display: none; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .wrap, .hero, .console-sec, .sec, .download, .beta-body { padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px; }
      .investigate { flex-direction: column; }
      .investigate .btn { width: 100%; }
      h1.hero-title { font-size: 36px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- ============================ HOME ============================ -->
  <div id="page-home">

    <!-- Beta banner -->
    <div class="wrap">
      <button class="beta-banner" onclick="goBeta()">
        <span class="row">
          <span><b>Nnyx</b> and <b>Zzyn</b>, the new standard for software and network security, coming to beta for macOS soon. Reserve your seat.</span>
          <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- Nav -->
    <div class="nav">
      <div class="wrap inner">
        <img class="nav-logo" src="assets/syxx-logo.png" width="34" height="34" alt="Syxx">
        <span class="wordmark">Syxx</span>
        <div class="spacer"></div>
        <a class="link" href="#features">Features</a>
        <a class="link" href="#console">Console</a>
        <a class="link" href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
        <a class="btn-nav" href="#download">Download</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <div class="hero">
      <img class="hero-logo" src="assets/syxx-logo.png" width="118" height="118" alt="Syxx">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">DNS Investigation Suite</div>
        <h1 class="hero-title">Syxx Lyin' Eyes</h1>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-desc">Every resolver tells a story. Syxx traces DNS lookups end to end — spoofed answers, poisoned caches, silent exfiltration — and shows you exactly which responses are lying.</p>

      <div class="investigate">
        <input id="domain-input" class="field" type="text" placeholder="example.com" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
        <button class="btn" onclick="runInvestigation()">Investigate</button>
      </div>

      <!-- License activation gate. Live investigation is a paid, server-side query — the
           website is NOT a free bypass of the app paywall. Hidden until a query is attempted. -->
      <div id="activation-row" class="gate-row hidden">
        <input id="license-input" class="field" type="text" placeholder="Enter your Syxx Pro license key…" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
        <button class="btn btn-solid" style="min-width:120px;" onclick="activateLicense()">Activate</button>
      </div>
      <div id="gate-msg" class="gate-msg hidden"></div>

      <div class="live">
        <span class="dot-live"></span>
        <span id="live-status-text">Passive DNS index live</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Console demo -->
    <div id="console" class="console-sec">
      <div class="terminal">
        <div class="term-bar">
          <div class="dots"><span class="d-red"></span><span class="d-yellow"></span><span class="d-green"></span></div>
          <span class="title">syxx — a bedtime tale</span>
        </div>
        <div class="term-body" id="term-body">
          <div class="t-cmd">you@syxx ~ % story --once-upon-a-resolver</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Features -->
    <div id="features" class="wrap sec">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <div class="sec-eyebrow">What Syxx sees</div>
        <h2 class="sec-title">Catch the resolvers that are lying</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10Z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></div>
          <div class="card-title">Spoof Detection</div>
          <div class="card-desc">Compare answers across resolvers and flag responses that don't match authoritative truth.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h10"/><circle cx="19" cy="18" r="2.5"/></svg></div>
          <div class="card-title">Tunnel Forensics</div>
          <div class="card-desc">Spot exfiltration hidden in TXT and NULL records with entropy and cadence analysis.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="6" cy="19" r="3"/><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"/><path d="M9 19h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-11a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H15"/></svg></div>
          <div class="card-title">Resolver Timeline</div>
          <div class="card-desc">Replay every hop of a lookup — cache hits, forwarders, and who answered first.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tools-label">Six canonical tools, one app</div>
      <div class="grid-3" id="tools-grid"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pricing -->
    <div id="pricing" class="pricing sec">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <div class="sec-eyebrow">Pricing</div>
        <h2 class="sec-title">Free locally. $2 for the cloud.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="price-grid">
        <div class="plan">
